      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "col2_h",
      "x": 560, "y": 712, "width": 500, "height": 26,
      "text": "2  ·  LE LEVIER — les outils libres", "originalText": "2  ·  LE LEVIER — les outils libres",
      "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#7e22ce", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 300012,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300013, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "col3_h",
      "x": 1080, "y": 712, "width": 470, "height": 26,
      "text": "3  ·  APRÈS — le collectif maîtrise", "originalText": "3  ·  APRÈS — le collectif maîtrise",
      "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#15803d", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 300014,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300015, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "col1_body",
      "x": 60, "y": 752, "width": 470, "height": 120,
      "text": "•  Flux Enedis chiffrés (AES), XML opaques\n•  Outils propriétaires, dépendance\n•  Des données qu'on ne peut pas vérifier", "originalText": "•  Flux Enedis chiffrés (AES), XML opaques\n•  Outils propriétaires, dépendance\n•  Des données qu'on ne peut pas vérifier",
      "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#57534e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 300020,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300021, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.6
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "col2_ec",
      "x": 560, "y": 752, "width": 500, "height": 130,
      "text": "electricore — le moteur\n•  ingère & déchiffre les flux Enedis\n•  vérifie : doublons, ruptures, trous\n•  calcule : énergies, TURPE, CTA, Accise\n•  expose une API REST sécurisée", "originalText": "electricore — le moteur\n•  ingère & déchiffre les flux Enedis\n•  vérifie : doublons, ruptures, trous\n•  calcule : énergies, TURPE, CTA, Accise\n•  expose une API REST sécurisée",
      "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#57534e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 300030,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300031, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.6
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "col2_so",
      "x": 560, "y": 902, "width": 500, "height": 100,
      "text": "souscriptions_odoo — l'addon Odoo\n•  consomme l'API via electricore-client\n•  gère souscriptions & périodes\n•  produit des factures maîtrisées", "originalText": "souscriptions_odoo — l'addon Odoo\n•  consomme l'API via electricore-client\n•  gère souscriptions & périodes\n•  produit des factures maîtrisées",
      "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#57534e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 300032,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300033, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.6
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "col3_body",
      "x": 1080, "y": 752, "width": 480, "height": 130,
      "text": "•  Réappropriation : tes données t'appartiennent\n•  Transparence : facturation juste & traçable\n•  Libre (AGPL) : réutilisable par d'autres collectifs\n•  Maîtrise technique : stack moderne, testée", "originalText": "•  Réappropriation : tes données t'appartiennent\n•  Transparence : facturation juste & traçable\n•  Libre (AGPL) : réutilisable par d'autres collectifs\n•  Maîtrise technique : stack moderne, testée",
      "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#57534e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 300040,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 300041, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.6
    },

